# Browser-safe Back4App keys are stored in back4app-config.js.
# Never place the Back4App Master Key, GitHub OAuth token, or token-encryption key in frontend files or Git.
# Configure these server-side values in Back4App Parse Config:
# SENTRIX_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID
# SENTRIX_GITHUB_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY (64 hex characters / 32 random bytes)
